    "body": "Some wallet functional tests start or restart nodes they never use:\n\n- `wallet_basic.py`: node 3 hasn't been used since the `resendwallettransactions` check was removed in 2019 (f5162458cd), but the test still starts, stops and restarts it. Without it, the sync calls no longer need `self.nodes[0:3]`.\n\n- `wallet_signrawtransactionwithwallet.py` and `wallet_derivehdkey.py` each start a second node that is never used.\n\n- `wallet_sendall.py` restarts node 0 and reloads its wallets twice in a row with the same arguments.\n\nNo coverage changes. Each test runs a bit faster, about 0.2–0.4 s per test locally.",
